WEBVTT

00:08:59.827 --> 00:09:03.247
They have integrated
a wider range of activities

00:09:03.289 --> 00:09:04.790
such as volleyball.

00:09:05.332 --> 00:09:06.584
And just like that,

00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:08.794
teenage girls came back to parks.

00:09:09.712 --> 00:09:13.090
And this has benefited teenage girls,
but not only them.

00:09:13.716 --> 00:09:16.010
Every year since 2009,

00:09:16.051 --> 00:09:17.886
except for COVID years,

00:09:17.928 --> 00:09:22.224
Vienna has been named
the best city in the world to live in.

00:09:23.475 --> 00:09:26.228
Now, it's not just the gendered approach,

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:29.648
but it clearly contributed
because for the first time,

00:09:29.648 --> 00:09:33.402
the specific needs of the other
half of the population